ured ("project" → finds closest [data-project-preview] → [data-project-preview-visual]). Preserves anchor semantics, prefetching, keyboard, and modified-click behavior.\n\n3. SmoothScroll: Added minimal context exposing only stop()/start(). Raw Lenis instance stays private. All existing options preserved.\n\nVERIFICATION RESULTS:\n- No ViewTransition APIs: PASS\n- No GSAP Flip: PASS\n- No setTimeout/sleep: PASS\n- Token usage (MOTION_DURATION.standard, GSAP_EASE.cinematic): PASS\n- No useState: PASS\n- No new dependencies: PASS\n- All routes 200/404 correct: PASS\n- No runtime errors in logs: PASS\n- Scope audit: Only expected files changed\n- Preview system, cursor, text motion, tokens, content, next.config: ALL UNCHANGED\n\nREADY FOR STEP 14: YES', 'timeout': 1800000}
