12:55:02 [[chatgpt-bridge]] chatgpt-bridge.mcp INFO Tool call: name=ask_chatgpt args={'prompt': 'Here is the full context of this project:\n\n## Project: Fall 2026 Course Materials Repository\n**Location:** `/Users/anuragkoushik/Desktop/Fall26/`\n**Purpose:** Personal course materials repository for University of Alberta Fall 2026 term (September 1 – December 8). Aggregates syllabi, lecture notes, exam/assignment schedules, and lab information across 7 enrolled courses.\n\n## Courses Enrolled (7)\n| Code | Name | Section |\n|------|------|---------|\n| ECE302 | Electronic Devices | D22 |\n| ECE449 | Intelligent Systems Engineering | D42 |\n| ECE478 | (microwave/RF course) | D31 |\n| ECE485 | Digital Communications | D11 |\n| ECE490 | Electrical Engineering Design Project I | D51 |\n| ENGG400 | The Practice of the Engineering Profession | — |\n| SUST201 | Introduction to Sustainability | — |\n\n## Directory Structure\n```\nFall26/\n├── schedule.md              # Master schedule: exams, quizzes, midterms, assignments\n├── PDF/                     # PDF course materials (syllabi, lectures, labs, assignments)\n│   ├── ECE302-Electronic-Devices/Lectures/\n│   ├── ECE449-Intelligent-Systems-Engineering/\n│   ├── ECE485-Digital-Communications/PDFs/Lecture/\n│   ├── ECE490-Electrical-Engineering-Design-Project-I/Assignment1/\n│   ├── ENGG400-The-Practice-of-the-Engineering-Profession/\n│   └── SUST201-Introduction-to-Sustainability/\n├── MD/                      # Markdown-converted course materials\n│   ├── ECE302/ (Syllabus.md, Lab Schedule.md)\n│   ├── ECE449/ (Syllabus.md, LabSchedule.md)\n│   ├── ECE485/ (Syllabus.md, Lecture chapters 00-08 with figures)\n│   ├── ECE490/ (Syllabus.md)\n│   ├── ENGG400/ (Syllabus.md)\n│   └── SUST201/ (Syllabus.md)\n├── misc/                    # Working files\n│   ├── schedule.md          # (copy of master schedule)\n│   ├── FallCalender.ics / FallCalender_Updated.ics  # iCal calendar exports\n│   ├── schedule_trial1.md / schedule_trial1.filtered.md / schedule_trial1.unfiltered.backup.md\n│   ├── verify_schedule.py / test_verify_schedule.py  # Automated schedule verification\n│   ├── claudereq.txt / claudereq copy.json  # Claude API request logs\n│   └── .mcp.json\n└── pdftomarkdown/           # Python virtual environment for marker-pdf\n```\n\n## Key Files\n- **`schedule.md`** (91 lines): Master schedule with all exams, quizzes, midterms, and assignment dates across all 7 courses. Includes detailed notes per course about exam policies (open book, formula sheets, attendance requirements, etc.)\n- **`.claude/INSTRUCTIONS.md`**: Strict agent operating instructions — correctness-first, verify-before-claiming, exhaustive approach. Do not stop until confident of correctness.\n- **`verify_schedule.py` / `test_verify_schedule.py`**: Automated verification system that cross-checks schedule against syllabi PDFs.\n- **`FallCalender.ics`**: iCal export for calendar apps.\n\n## Git History (recent)\n```\n26a3838 Step 4: Filter schedule to registered sections (110 → 80 rows) and fix ICS import issues\n34a724a Commit all remaining changes\n9a31d60 Add automated schedule verification system (Phase 4)\n42710f1 update\n2cf3c77 Add ECE302 lab schedule, update schedule.md, and fix iCal events\needb7ee Add ECE485 digital communications lecture chapters (00–08)\n74b0203 Add assignment dates table for ECE449, ECE485, ECE478, ECE490, ECE302\n4186892 Add SUST201, remove NS115, and correct Fall 2026 schedule\n483ff88 485 book\nafb38ed Move all course PDFs to PDF/ and cleaned MDs to MD/\n18b9d9a Remove all image files and JSON metadata from syllabus directories\n61938e3 Fix ECE449 syllabus year typos: 2025 → 2026 for midterm and group project\ne6d4bfc Fix ECE485 quiz dates: add missing Quiz 3, fix Quiz 4 date, remove phantom Sep 29 quiz\n4485c55 Fix schedule errors: ECE302 Midterm 2 day, ECE478 midterm date, ECE485 quiz labels\nf11ce34 Add consolidated Exams, Quizzes & Midterms section to schedule\n09e95a5 Revise Fall 2026 schedule from all 7 syllabi\nebf12b2 Add Syllabus metadata JSONs (images left untracked)\n362ca64 Convert all syllabi to markdown using marker-pdf\n3b40aa6 Move Syllabus.md from PDFs to MDs in ECE302\n5d2e33e Normalize all PDF subdirectories to PDFs and add missing syllabi\n```\n\n## Current State\n- Schedule has been filtered down to 80 rows for registered sections only\n- ECE485 has full lecture chapter MDs (00-08) with figures\n- ECE302 has lecture PDFs (unconverted) and a lab schedule in MD\n- ECE449 has syllabus + lab schedule in MD\n- SUST201 is fully asynchronous online (Canvas, Respondus LockDown Browser)\n- ENGG400 is credit/no-credit with 7 weekly quizzes\n- Some PDFs are unconverted (ECE302 lectures, ECE449 materials)\n- Verification system exists but was deleted from main branch, lives in `misc/`\n- Deleted files include: `.mcp.json`, `CLAUDE.md` (old version), `schedule.md` (old version), `test_verify_schedule.py`, `verify_schedule.py` — they still exist in `misc/`\n\n## Key Schedule Details\n- Term: Fall 2026, Sept 1 – Dec 8\n- ECE485: 6 quizzes (2% each), 3 term exams (25% each)\n- ECE302: 2 midterms (15% each), 1 final (40%), weekly labs\n- ECE449: Midterm 20%, group project 10%, final 40%\n- ECE478: Midterm 20% (tentative Nov 2), final 30% (tentative)\n- ECE490: Project assignments, no traditional exams\n- ENGG400: 7 quizzes CR/F, min 10/13 attendance, no midterms/finals\n- SUST201: 5 quizzes 1% each, 2 midterms (21.5% + 22.5%), final 45%'}
