pository Calendar Evidence ===\n\n| Source | Event | Existing Value | Notes |\n|--------|-------|---------------|-------|\n| misc/schedule_trial1.md | Last Day of Classes | Dec 8, 2026 | STALE — compiled assumption, not from UAlberta official calendar |\n| misc/schedule_trial1.md | Exam Period | Dec 9–22 | Correct per UAlberta |\n| misc/schedule.md | Last Day of Classes | Dec 8, 2026 | STALE — same compiled assumption |\n| misc/schedule.md | Exam Period | Dec 9–22 | Correct |\n| misc/FallCalender_Updated.ics | UNTIL (all 10 recurring blocks) | 20261208T235959Z | All UNTIL = Dec 8, not Dec 9 |\n| misc/FallCalender_Updated.ics | Last Day of Classes event | Dec 8, 2026 | STALE |\n| MD/ECE302 Lab Schedule | Last Day of Classes | Dec 8, 2026 | Course-specific table says Dec 8 |\n| MD/ECE490 Syllabus | Term range | "September 1 to Dec 8" | Course syllabus says Dec 8 |\n| MD/ECE490 Syllabus | Week 15 | "08 Dec — Fall 2026 Last Day of Classes" | Course syllabus table says Dec 8 |\n| MD/ECE449 Syllabus | Exam period | "December 9 to December 22" | Matches UAlberta |\n| MD/ECE302 Lab Schedule | Holidays | Labour Day Sep 7, Truth+Reconciliation Sep 30, Thanksgiving Oct 12, Remembrance Day Nov 11, Reading Week Nov 9-13 | All match UAlberta |\n\n=== Source Comparison ===\n\n| Event | Repository Value | UAlberta Value | Match? | Discrepancy Type | Recommended Resolution |\n|-------|-----------------|----------------|--------|-----------------|----------------------|\n| Last Day of Classes | Dec 8, 2026 | Dec 9, 2026 | NO | STALE_COMPILED_DATA | UAlberta official says Dec 9. Course syllabi (ECE302 Lab, ECE490) say Dec 8. Need adjudication below. |\n| Exam Period | Dec 9–22 | Dec 10–22 | PARTIAL | STALE_COMPILED_DATA | Old schedule had Dec 9 as exam period start. UAlberta says Dec 10. Dec 9 is the last instructional day, not exam start. |\n| Fall Term Start | Sep 1 (Tuesday) | Sep 1 (Tuesday) | YES | — | Confirmed |\n| Labour Day | Sep 7 (Monday) | Sep 7 (Monday) | YES | — | Confirmed |\n| Truth & Reconciliation | Sep 30 (Wednesday) | Sep 30 (Wednesday) | YES | — | Confirmed |\n| Thanksgiving | Oct 12 (Monday) | Oct 12 (Monday) | YES | — | Confirmed |\n| Reading Week | Nov 9–13 | Nov 9–13 | YES | — | Confirmed |\n| Remembrance Day | Nov 11 (Wednesday) | Nov 11 (Wednesday) | YES | — | Confirmed |\n| Christmas closure | Not in repo | Dec 25–31 | N/A | — | Boundary metadata only, not needed in core |\n| Winter Term begins | Not in repo | Jan 4, 2027 | N/A | — | Boundary metadata only, not needed in core |\n\n=== December 8 vs December 9 Adjudication ===\n\n**Origin of Dec 8:**\n1. misc/schedule_trial1.md line 99: "Last Day of Classes" = Dec 8 (compiled from multiple sources)\n2. misc/schedule.md line 4: "September 1 – December 8" (compiled header)\n3. MD/ECE302 Lab Schedule line 21: "2026-12-08 | Tuesday | Last Day of Classes"\n4. MD/ECE490 Syllabus line 4: "Fall 2026 – September 1 to Dec 8"\n5. MD/ECE490 Syllabus line 172: Week 15 table "08 Dec — Fall 2026 Last Day of Classes"\n6. misc/FallCalender_Updated.ics: All 10 UNTIL values = 20261208T235959Z\n7. misc/FallCalender_Updated.ics: "Last Day of Classes" event = Dec 8\n\n**Official UAlberta result:**\nLast day of Fall Term classes = December 9, 2026 (Wednesday). Per the official 2026-27 Academic Schedule.\n\n**Effect on final schedule:**\nDec 8 came from compiled course syllabi/tables and ICS UNTIL values. The UAlberta official calendar supersedes individual course syllabi for the university-wide last instructional day. However:\n- Some courses may legitimately have no meeting on Dec 9 (e.g., ENGG400 last lecture is Dec 4, SUST201 final ends Dec 8, ECE485 Term Exam 3 is Dec 8).\n- The university-wide LAST_INSTRUCTIONAL_DAY should be Dec 9, but individual course LAST_MEETING may be earlier.\n- ICS UNTIL=20261208 should remain as-is for recurring blocks (last scheduled meeting).\n\n=== December 9 vs December 10 Exam-Period Adjudication ===\n\n**Origin of Dec 9 exam period start:**\n1. misc/schedule.md line 37-39: "During exam period (Dec 9–22)" for ECE302, ECE478, ECE449 finals\n2. misc/schedule.md line 42: "ECE449: Final exam period is Dec 9–22, 2026"\n3. misc/schedule_trial1.md line 214: "Final exam period: December 9 – December 22, 2026"\n4. misc/schedule_trial1.unfiltered.backup.md line 228: "Final exam period: December 9 – December 22, 2026"\n5. MD/ECE449 Syllabus line 66: "The final exam period for the Fall 2026 term is from December 9 to December 22, 2026"\n\n**Official UAlberta result:**\nFall Term examinations run December 10–22, 2026.\n\n**Effect on final schedule:**\nThe Dec 9 exam period start came from ECE449 syllabus AND compiled schedule files. However, ECE449 syllabus may be using "exam period" loosely (the window during which a final exam COULD be scheduled). The UAlberta official calendar says exams RUN Dec 10–22. For the canonical calendar layer, use Dec 10–22. Course-specific finals marked TBA should note "within Dec 10–22 exam period" for accuracy. The ECE449 syllabus statement should be noted as the course\'s understanding, not the official calendar.\n\n=== Recurring Timetable / EXDATE Audit ===\n\n| Course | Section | Pattern | Existing Exclusions | Required Exclusions | Match? | Action Needed |\n|--------|---------|---------|-------------------|-------------------|--------|---------------|\n| ECE490 | A1 | Mon 08:00–08:50 | Sep 7 (Labour), Oct 12 (Thanksgiving), Nov 9 (Reading Wk) | Same + Nov 11 (Remembrance), Nov 13 (Reading Wk) | NO | Add EXDATE for Nov 11 (Wed, not Mon anyway), Nov 13 (Fri, not Mon anyway) — actually Mon-only, so only Mon holidays apply: Sep 7 ✓, Oct 12 ✓, Nov 9 ✓. Remembrance Day (Nov 11 Wed) does not affect Mon. Reading Week (Nov 9-13) includes Mon Nov 9 ✓. **OK — no action needed** |\n| ECE449 | A1 | Mon/Wed/Fri 13:00–13:50 | Sep 7, Sep 30, Oct 12, Nov 9, Nov 11, Nov 13 | All holidays + Reading Week | YES | Sep 7(Mon) ✓, Sep 30(Wed) ✓, Oct 12(Mon) ✓, Nov 9(Mon) ✓, Nov 11(Wed) ✓, Nov 13(Fri) ✓. **OK** |\n| ENGG400 | A1 | Fri 12:00–12:50 | Nov 13 (Reading Wk) | Oct 12 (Thanksgiving), Nov 13 (Reading Wk) | NO | Missing EXDATE for Oct 12 (Thanksgiving). Has Nov 13 ✓. **ACTION: Add Oct 12** |\n| ECE485 | A1 | Tue/Thu 11:00–12:20 | Nov 10, Nov 12 | None of these are holidays/Reading Week | PARTIAL | Exclusions are Tue Nov 10 + Thu Nov 12 — these don\'t match any official holiday or Reading Week. Reading Week starts Nov 9(Mon). These look like TBA exclusions. **ACTION: Investigate — possibly TBA exam/midterm dates** |\n| ECE485 | D11 | Mon 14:00–16:50 | Sep 7 (Labour), Oct 12 (Thanksgiving), Nov 9 (Reading Wk) | Same + Nov 11 (Remembrance) | PARTIAL | Has Sep 7 ✓, Oct 12 ✓, Nov 9 ✓. Missing Nov 11 (Wed, not Mon — doesn\'t affect Mon). **OK** |\n| ECE302 | D22 | Tue 14:00–16:50 | Nov 10 (Reading Wk Tue) | None of these are holidays | PARTIAL | Has Nov 10 ✓. But Reading Week is Nov 9(Mon)–13(Fri), so Tue Nov 10 ✓ is correct. What about Sep 30 (Truth/Reconciliation Wed, not Tue) and Nov 11 (Remembrance Wed, not Tue)? Tue-only pattern unaffected. **OK** |\n| ECE449 | D42 | Thu 14:00–16:50 | Nov 12 (Reading Wk Thu) | None of these are holidays | PARTIAL | Has Nov 12 ✓. Reading Week Thu Nov 12 ✓. Sep 30 is Wed, Oct 12 is Mon, Nov 11 is Wed — none affect Thu. **OK** |\n| ECE302 | A2 | Mon/Wed/Fri 10:00–10:50 | Sep 7, Sep 30, Oct 12, Nov 9, Nov 11, Nov 13 | All holidays + Reading Week | YES | All 6 exclusions present and correct. **OK** |\n| ECE302 | E32 | Wed 12:00–12:50 | Sep 30, Nov 11 | Sep 30 (Truth), Nov 11 (Remembrance) | YES | Both Wed holidays excluded. Reading Week Wed Nov 11 already excluded. **OK** |\n| ECE490 | D51 | Fri 14:00–16:50 | Nov 13 (Reading Wk) | Oct 12 (Thanksgiving), Nov 13 (Reading Wk) | NO | Missing EXDATE for Oct 12 (Thanksgiving). Has Nov 13 ✓. **ACTION: Add Oct 12** |\n\n=== Additional Administrative Dates ===\n\n| Date | Event | Authority | Include in Final Schedule? |\n|------|-------|-----------|--------------------------|\n| TBA | Fall registration/add-drop deadline | UAlberta Registrar | Not available — would need to check registrar page. Skip for now. |\n| TBA | Tuition/payment deadline | UAlberta Registrar | Same — skip for now. |\n| TBA | Withdrawal deadline | UAlberta Registrar | Same — skip for now. |\n\nNo administrative deadlines included. They are not directly relevant to the course schedule document and would require live lookup of the 2026 Registrar page.\n\n=== Canonical Semester-Wide Dataset ===\n\n| Start | End | Type | Title | Class Effect | Authority |\n|-------|-----|------|-------|--------------|-----------|\n| 2026-09-01 | 2026-09-01 | FIRST_DAY | Fall Term classes begin | TERM_START | UAlberta Official 2026-27 |\n| 2026-09-07 | 2026-09-07 | HOLIDAY | Labour Day | NO_CLASS | UAlberta Official |\n| 2026-09-30 | 2026-09-30 | UNIVERSITY_CLOSURE | National Day for Truth and Reconciliation | NO_CLASS | UAlberta Official |\n| 2026-10-12 | 2026-10-12 | HOLIDAY | Thanksgiving Day | NO_CLASS | UAlberta Official |\n| 2026-11-09 | 2026-11-13 | READING_WEEK | Fall Reading Week | NO_REGULAR_CLASSES | UAlberta Official |\n| 2026-11-11 | 2026-11-11 | HOLIDAY | Remembrance Day | UNIVERSITY_CLOSED | UAlberta Official |\n| 2026-12-09 | 2026-12-09 | LAST_DAY | Last day of Fall Term classes | TERM_END | UAlberta Official |\n| 2026-12-10 | 2026-12-22 | FINAL_EXAM_PERIOD | Fall Term examinations | EXAM_PERIOD | UAlberta Official |\n\n=== Impact on Existing Canonical Counts ===\n\n- 80 one-off rows: NO CHANGE expected. The Dec 8→Dec 9 shift affects the calendar layer, not individual course one-off events.\n- 45 unique course-event start dates: NO CHANGE. These are course-specific event dates, not the university-wide last day.\n- 48 occupied dates: NO CHANGE. Same reasoning.\n- 10 recurring blocks: MINOR CHANGE needed — ENGG400 A1 needs Oct 12 EXDATE, ECE490 D51 needs Oct 12 EXDATE. ECE485 A1 Nov 10/12 exclusions need investigation (likely TBA exam/midterm dates).\n- 2 TBA finals: NO CHANGE.\n- 1 contingency event: NO CHANGE.\n\n=== Remaining Discrepancies ===\n\n1. ECE485 A1 (Tue/Thu 11:00–12:20) has EXDATE for Nov 10 (Tue) and Nov 12 (Thu) — these are during Reading Week (Nov 9–13). Reading Week already excludes Nov 9–13 for all days, so individual Tue/Thu exclusions are redundant but not wrong. However, the ICS RRULE only lists these two dates, not the full Reading Week. This suggests these were TBA exam/midterm windows that got pre-excluded. **ACTION: Verify if ECE485 has TBA exams during Reading Week.**\n\n2. ECE449 syllabus says exam period is Dec 9–22 but UAlberta official says Dec 10–22. **RESOLVED: Use UAlberta official Dec 10–22 for the canonical calendar layer. Note the syllabus discrepancy in source audit.**\n\n3. ENGG400 A1 and ECE490 D51 are missing Oct 12 (Thanksgiving) EXDATE. **ACTION: Add to ICS.**\n\n=== Modification Check ===\n\nCONFIRMED: Zero repository files modified during Step 7. All work done via inspection and analysis only.', 'timeout': 1800000}
