_END |\n| misc/FallCalender_Updated.ics UNTIL values | 20261208T235959Z (all 10 blocks) | ICS_RECURRENCE_END | Correct — last scheduled meeting day | Keep |\n| misc/FallCalender_Updated.ics "Last Day of Classes" event | Dec 8 | UNIVERSITY_LAST_DAY_LABEL | LABEL ERROR — should be "Registered Section Timetable End" | Reclassify |\n| MD/ECE302 Lab Schedule line 21 | "2026-12-08 | Last Day of Classes" | COURSE_SPECIFIC_LAST_ACTIVITY | LABEL ERROR — course-specific, not university-wide | Reclassify as COURSE_SPECIFIC_LAST_ACTIVITY for ECE302 |\n| MD/ECE490 Syllabus line 4 | "September 1 to Dec 8" | REGISTERED_SECTION_END | Correct | Keep |\n| MD/ECE490 Syllabus line 172 | "08 Dec — Fall 2026 Last Day of Classes" | UNIVERSITY_LAST_DAY_LABEL | LABEL ERROR — course syllabus using university-wide label for registered section end | Reclassify |\n| MD/ECE449 Syllabus line 62 | "Group Project | December 8, 2026" | COURSE_SPECIFIC_DEADLINE | Correct | Keep |\n| MD/ECE485 Syllabus | "Term Exam 3 | Dec 8" | COURSE_SPECIFIC_ASSESSMENT | Correct | Keep |\n| MD/SUST201 Syllabus | "Final Exam Dec 7–8" | COURSE_SPECIFIC_ASSESSMENT | Correct | Keep |\n\n=== Exam-Period Resolution ===\n\nOfficial UAlberta period: December 10–22, 2026 (examinations other than consolidated examinations).\n\nECE449 syllabus discrepancy: ECE449 syllabus states "The final exam period for the Fall 2026 term is from December 9 to December 22, 2026." This is off by one day relative to the official UAlberta calendar. The syllabus says Dec 9 as the start; UAlberta says Dec 10.\n\nTreatment:\n- Canonical calendar layer uses official UAlberta Dec 10–22.\n- ECE302 Final = TBA within Dec 10–22.\n- ECE449 Final = TBA within Dec 10–22. Note the syllabus discrepancy in verification notes.\n- ECE485 Term Exam 3 on Dec 8 = valid course-specific assessment before exam period (sourced from syllabus).\n- SUST201 Final window Dec 7–8 = valid course-specific assessment (sourced from syllabus).\n- ECE449 Group Project Dec 8 = va