cale reset?\n2. Is there a Windows Firewall rule that specifically blocks the Tailscale adapter?\n3. Could the WSL2 NAT mode + port proxy combination have a known issue on this Windows 11 build (26200.9168)?\n4. Should I try removing the port proxy and using a different approach (e.g., netsh portproxy to 127.0.0.1 instead of WSL2 IP)?\n\nPlease advise on the next approach. Do not configure Mosh yet.', 'timeout': 1800000}
