ately\n\nUART DESIGN\n- Compact horizontal packet: HEADER / TYPE / LENGTH / PAYLOAD / CHECKSUM\n- Displayed below architecture flow\n- Logic Cyan color for field labels\n- No packet simulator, no animated bytes\n\nPI SERVICE BRANCH\n- Four services: Notifications, Video, Google Drive, Remote Access\n- Horizontal bar below UART packet\n- Muted grey text\n\nRESPONSIVE DESIGN\n- Desktop: vertical architecture flow with centered cards\n- Mobile (≤768px): same vertical flow, flex-wrap on UART fields and Pi services, smaller padding\n- No horizontal scrolling, no hover dependency\n\nACCESSIBILITY\n- Semantic <section id="flagship" aria-labelledby="flagship-heading">\n- <h2> heading\n- Architecture labels are real text\n- Connection lines aria-hidden="true"\n- UART packet has aria-label\n- Pi services have aria-label\n- No interaction required\n\nREDUCED MOTION\n- All stages at full opacity (1) and scale (1) immediately\n- Complete architecture visible without scrolling\n- No decorative progressive powering\n\nSIGNAL INTEGRATION\n- Section has id="flagship" (distinct from id="systems")\n- Follows System Map: Hero → SystemMap → FeaturedSystem\n- Same visual language (monospace labels, signal colors, bordered cards)\n\nVERIFICATION\n- Lint: PASS (0 errors, 0 warnings)\n- Build: PASS (compiled successfully, 6 static pages)\n- Routes: / 200, /projects 200, /about 200, /contact 200\n- plan.md: SHA-256 match confirmed\n- No new dependencies\n- No Canvas/WebGL/Three.js/GSAP\n- 7 stages confirmed\n- UART packet fields confirmed\n- Pi 4 services confirmed\n- aria-hidden on decorative elements confirmed\n- Reduced motion handled confirmed\n- Hero/SystemMap/SignalPath/Header/mobile nav unchanged confirmed\n\nVISUAL QA STATUS\n- Progressive scroll activation: Not visually observed\n- Mobile wrap behavior: Not visually observed\n- Reduced-motion toggle: Not visually observed\n- Console errors: Not inspected in browser\n- Deferred to when graphical browser available\n- Carried forward f