ug]\n- No filtering, no hover previews\n\nDYNAMIC ROUTING\n- generateStaticParams() returns all 5 project slugs\n- Unknown slugs → notFound() → 404\n- generateMetadata() sets title + description per project\n\nHOME SECURITY CASE STUDY\nSections rendered (only when content exists):\n1. Hero — number, accent badge, title, summary, disciplines/hardware/software tags\n2. Problem — paragraph\n3. Constraints — ordered list\n4. Architecture — monospace pre-formatted diagram\n5. Design — ordered list\n6. Verification — paragraph\n7. Results — paragraph\n8. Reflection — paragraph\n9. Next Project → Ultrasonic Digital Tape Measure\n\nEmpty sections omitted (no placeholders).\n\nRESPONSIVE DESIGN\n- Single-column case-study flow\n- Metadata wraps on mobile\n- No horizontal scrolling at any breakpoint\n\nACCESSIBILITY\n- Semantic heading hierarchy (h1 project title, h2 sections)\n- ARIA labels on project overview and next project\n- Focus-visible outlines use signal green\n\nMETADATA\n- Title: "{Project Title} | Anurag Koushik"\n- Description: project summary\n- No OG-image generation (deferred)\n\nVERIFICATION\nLint: PASS (0 errors, 0 warnings)\nBuild: PASS (11 pages, all generated)\nRoute Tests:\n  / → 200\n  /projects → 200\n  /projects/home-security → 200\n  /about → 200\n  /contact → 200\n  /projects/unknown-slug → 404\n\nContent checks on /projects/home-security:\n  PROJECT 01: Present\n  Home Security Embedded System: Present\n  Problem: Present\n  Architecture: Present\n  Disciplines/hardware tags: Present\n  Next Project → Ultrasonic: Present\n  Metadata title: Correct\n\nAll 5 projects listed on /projects index: Home Security, Ultrasonic, Joystick, FPGA, Power\n\nVISUAL QA STATUS: Deferred (no graphical browser available)\n\nREGRESSION CHECKS\n- Existing homepage unchanged\n- /about unchanged (still placeholder)\n- /contact unchanged (still placeholder)\n- plan.md unchanged\n- No new dependencies\n- No duplicated Home Security data (single source: src/content/projects.ts)\n\nOUTCOME\nProject page architecture proven with one real case study. Remaining 4 projects auto-available via generateStaticParams.\n\nEVIDENCE\nCommit: 4716b07 feat: build project page foundation\n10 files changed, 883 insertions, 2 deletions\n\nDEVIATIONS\n- Architecture diagram: single-line text with white-space: pre (data model stores as single string)\n- Accent badge: data-accent attribute with CSS attribute selectors (cleaner than separate class names)\n\nREMAINING WORK\n- Step 10B: Populate remaining 4 project case studies\n- Step 11: About/Resume/Contact pages\n- Step 12: Mobile Pass\n- Step 13: Performance Pass\n- Step 14: Accessibility Pass\n- Step 15: Final Polish\n\nPlease confirm if Step 10A is accepted.', 'timeout': 300000}
