13:04:56 [[chatgpt-bridge]] chatgpt-bridge.mcp INFO Tool call: name=ask_chatgpt args={'prompt': 'Please review Milestone 14C corrections.\n\n## What I Fixed\n\n### 1. Engineering Network (SystemMap)\n**Root cause**: Connection lines used `stroke: var(--deep-grey)` (#1a1e1d) on background #080A0A — zero contrast.\n\n**Fixes**:\n- Connection stroke: `var(--deep-grey)` → `color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-text-muted) 25% 0%)` — now visible\n- Inactive node opacity: 0.5 → 0.6\n- Section padding: 6rem → 4rem\n- Header margin: 4rem → 2.5rem\n- Network bottom margin: 4rem → 2.5rem\n- Signal margin: 3rem → 2rem\n- Detail panel margins: 2rem → 1.5rem\n\n### 2. Home Security Architecture (FeaturedSystem)\n**Root cause**: UART packet and Pi services rendered AFTER all stages (including Mobile App).\n\n**Fixes**:\n- Moved UART detail inline — renders after "UART Bridge" stage within the map loop\n- Moved Pi services inline — renders after "Raspberry Pi" stage within the map loop\n- Inactive stage opacity: 0.5 → 0.65 (readable at section bottom)\n\n### 3. Ultrasonic Tape Measure (SelectedWork)\n**Root cause**: Readout and measurement visualization in one absolutely-positioned container.\n\n**Fixes**:\n- Restructured with flexbox: `display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1.5rem`\n- Created `.measureZone` (visualization) with `min-height: 180px; flex: 1`\n- Created `.readoutZone` (readout + controls) with `border-top` separator\n- Readout removed from `position: absolute` — now flows naturally in readoutZone\n\n### 4. Power Engineering (SelectedWork)\n**Fixes**:\n- Diagram height: 100px → 140px (desktop), 80px → 100px (mobile)\n- Added "V" label to voltage phasor, "I" to current phasor\n- Added "P", "Q", "S" labels to power triangle\n\n### 5. FPGA Truth Table (SelectedWork)\n**Fix**: Active row now has `border-color: var(--color-signal)` and subtle signal background tint\n\n### 6. Hero Signal (Hero)\n**Fixes**: Signal opacity 0.5 → 0.7, grid opacity 0.4 → 0.3\n\n## Verification\n- Lint: PASS (0 errors, 0 warnings)\n- Build: PASS (11 pages)\n- Routes: All 200\n\n## Git\nCommit: 4603359 fix: complete Milestone 14C visual corrections\n8 files changed, 322 insertions, 131 deletions\n\nPlease review and let me know if Step 14C is accepted or if there are remaining issues. Do not proceed to Step 15 until visually verified.'}
