13:19:18 [[chatgpt-bridge]] chatgpt-bridge.mcp INFO Tool call: name=ask_chatgpt args={'prompt': 'Please review Milestone 14C final fixes.\n\n## 1. Hydration Mismatch Fix (Root Cause Identified)\n\n**Exact cause**: `buildWaveformPath` in SelectedWork.tsx generates SVG `d` attributes using `Math.sin`/`Math.cos` with full floating-point precision. Server renders `y=29.371784818437433`, client renders `y=29.37178481843743` (last digit differs). React detects this as a hydration mismatch.\n\n**Fix**: Round y-coordinates to 2 decimal places: `Math.round((midY - amplitude * Math.sin(t + phase)) * 100) / 100`. This produces deterministic output identical on server and client. No library changes, no suppressHydrationWarning.\n\n**Verification**: Production build passes. The fix is deterministic — same input always produces same output on both server and client.\n\n## 2. Home Security Scroll Activation Fix\n\n**Root cause**: Stage opacity used `[at[0], at[0]+0.05]` activation range — only 5% scroll range per stage. With 7 stages across 0-1 scroll range, bottom stages (Services at 0.80, Mobile App at 0.92) had barely any activation window.\n\n**Fix**: Widened to `[at[0]-0.1, at[0]+0.1]` — 20% activation range. Each stage now activates as it approaches viewport center, stays illuminated during normal scrolling.\n\n**Preserved**: Stage ordering, content placement, reduced-motion behavior. No new animation framework.\n\n## 3. Git Status\n- Working tree: clean\n- Handoff: docs/handoffs/14a-critical-visual-repair.md\n- Commits:\n  - 4603359 Milestone 14C initial (8 files, +322/-131)\n  - 41eb703 Engineering Network refinement (2 files)\n  - cddcb01 Hydration + scroll activation (3 files, +39/-2)\n\n## 4. Verification\n- Lint: PASS (0 errors, 0 warnings)\n- Build: PASS (11 pages)\n- Routes: All 200\n\n## Please Review\n1. Is the hydration fix correct and minimal?\n2. Is the scroll activation fix appropriate?\n3. Can we now request visual verification from the user?\n\nThe implementation corrections are complete. We need visual confirmation of:\n- Engineering Network (connections visible, section compact)\n- Home Security (all stages readable during scroll)\n- Power Engineering (no hydration warning)\n- Ultrasonic (no overlap)\n- Hero (signal visible)'}
