13:56:12 [[chatgpt-bridge]] chatgpt-bridge.mcp INFO Tool call: name=ask_chatgpt args={'prompt': 'Please review the Engineering Network connection alignment fix.\n\n## Root Cause Identified\n\nThe SVG used `viewBox="0 0 800 620"` but the DOM node container was only `min-height: 500px`. Buttons positioned as percentages of 500px (`top: ${domain.y / 620 * 100}%`) did not align with SVG connections at raw viewBox y-coordinates (0-620). This created a 120px vertical offset — connections appeared to float between nodes rather than connecting them.\n\n## Fix Applied (Commit 5fcc657)\n\n1. **Restored `.systemMap__nodes` min-height to 620px** — matching SVG viewBox height so percentages align with coordinates\n2. **Increased connection visibility**: stroke 45% muted-grey → 55%, width 1.5→2\n3. **Made inactive node labels readable**: `color: var(--color-text)` instead of `var(--color-text-muted)`, added box-shadow\n4. **Made signal trace more prominent**: strokeWidth 1.5→2.5, opacity 0.8, node radius 3→4\n\n## Git Status\n- Working tree: clean\n- Handoff: docs/handoffs/14a-critical-visual-repair.md\n- All 14C commits:\n  - 4603359 Initial corrections\n  - 41eb703 Network refinement\n  - cddcb01 Hydration + scroll activation\n  - a32e0ce Signal trace integration\n  - 307b970 Mobile App activation fix\n  - 5fcc657 Connection alignment fix\n\n## Verification\n- Lint: PASS\n- Build: PASS (11 pages)\n- Routes: All 200\n\n## Please Review\n1. Is the connection alignment fix correct?\n2. Can we now request visual verification from the user?\n3. Is Step 15 unblocked once visual verification passes?\n\nThis was the key structural fix — the SVG and DOM buttons now share the same coordinate space. The connections should now visibly route between the actual node centers.'}
