h: 1152px (was ~768px)\n- Cards: 352px wide (was ~384px but in a narrow column)\n- Vertical connectors: 3px wide, 40px tall, rgb(139,146,144) at 30% opacity\n- Horizontal connectors: 3px wide, 100px tall, rgb(139,146,144) at 30% opacity\n- Scroll activation working: Sensor+Console at opacity 1, UART at 0.9, ESP32-S3/Pi at 0.65\n- Mobile: architecture fits within 375px viewport, cards stack vertically\n\nVERIFICATION:\n- Desktop (1280px): Architecture 1152px wide, cards 352px, row gap 32px — PASS\n- Mobile (375px): Architecture 343px, cards stack vertically, UART/Pi services wrap — PASS\n- Scroll activation: All stages activate at correct scroll positions — PASS\n- Build: PASS (TypeScript + static generation)\n- Lint: No errors\n\nREGRESSION CHECKS:\n- Engineering Network: 11 SVG lines still present — PASS\n- No changes to Engineering Network code — PASS\n- No other homepage sections modified — PASS\n\nOUTCOME: PASS\n\nGIT:\n- Commit: ed2254c feat: Home Security — rework architecture from narrow stack to wide layout\n- Commit: 945acfe docs: add Milestone 15B handoff document\n- Handoff: docs/handoffs/15b-home-security-visual-repair.md\n\nDEVIATIONS:\n- Removed Services stage node (stages[5]) instead of keeping it. This simplifies the layout and the services are still visible as a branch below Pi.\n- Used solid background-color for connectors instead of linear-gradient (gradient wasn't rendering in CSS modules).\n\nREMAINING WORK:\n- The removed Services stage loses its individual scroll activation. Services activate with the Pi stage instead.\n- Global signal system continuity across sections not addressed.\n- Hero composition not addressed.\n- Project demonstrations not addressed.\n- Contact section not addressed.\n\nPlease review and let me know if Milestone 2 is APPROVED and if I can proceed to the next priorities.", 'timeout': 1800000}
