mation framework: milestone explicitly forbade scroll-driven animations\n- SVG chevrons instead of CSS pseudo-elements: cleaner, no conflicts with homepage patterns\n- React component instead of raw SVG: easier CSS variable styling, better accessibility\n- Conditional rendering by slug: only affects Home Security, other 4 case studies untouched\n\nBROWSER VERIFICATION RESULTS\n- Desktop (1440×900): PASS — all 5 rows visible, nodes sized correctly, connectors aligned, no overflow\n- Mobile (390×844): PASS — rows stack vertically, horizontal connectors hidden, all text readable\n- Console errors: NONE\n- Other project pages (ultrasonic, joystick, fpga, power): ALL PASS — text blocks unchanged\n- Homepage, projects index, about, contact: ALL PASS — no regressions\n- Build (npx next build): PASS\n- Lint: pre-existing .cjs errors only (unrelated)\n\nREGRESSION CHECKS\n- /projects/home-security: PASS (new diagram renders)\n- /projects/ultrasonic-tape-measure: PASS (text block unchanged)\n- /projects/joystick-adc-uart: PASS (text block unchanged)\n- /projects/fpga-digital-logic: PASS (text block unchanged)\n- /projects/power-engineering: PASS (text block unchanged)\n- /: PASS\n- /projects: PASS\n- /about: PASS\n- /contact: PASS (Milestone 16B links intact)\n\nSCREENSHOTS\n- screenshots/home-security-case-study-architecture/before-desktop.png\n- screenshots/home-security-case-study-architecture/before-mobile.png\n- screenshots/home-security-case-study-architecture/after-desktop.png\n- screenshots/home-security-case-study-architecture/after-mobile.png\n\nHANDOFF: docs/handoffs/16c-home-security-case-study-architecture.md\nGIT COMMIT: 462cbac\n\nPlease review the before and after screenshots. Ask the website owner to upload all four screenshots to this ChatGPT conversation for visual validation.', 'timeout': 1800000}
