16:33:08 [[chatgpt-bridge]] chatgpt-bridge.mcp INFO Tool call: name=ask_chatgpt args={'prompt': 'Here is the M3 fix plan to address the 10 review findings. Please review and approve, or suggest changes.\n\n## M3 Fix Plan\n\n### Phase 1: Critical Fixes\n\n**1.1 Remove `POST /api/auth/bootstrap` from web API**\n- Remove the `/api/auth/bootstrap` route from `app/routers/auth.py`\n- Create `app/cli_bootstrap.py` — CLI script that accepts username/password interactively (no CLI args for password), checks for zero users, creates first admin with Argon2id hash\n- Tests: verify HTTP 404 on `/api/auth/bootstrap`, verify CLI works on empty DB, verify CLI rejects second bootstrap\n\n**1.2 Fix CSRF — HMAC + `/api/csrf-token` endpoint**\n- Fix `generate_csrf_token()` in `security.py` to use `hmac.new()` instead of `hashlib.sha256(raw + secret)`\n- Add `GET /api/csrf-token` endpoint — authenticated, returns HMAC-signed CSRF token in JSON body (not HttpOnly cookie)\n- Frontend flow: login → get session cookie + CSRF token in response body → store CSRF token in memory → include in `X-CSRF-Token` header for mutations\n\n**1.3 Fix session revocation**\n- `update_user`: already revokes sessions on role/is_active change — verify it\'s transactional\n- `get_current_user`: add `must_change_pw` check — if set, return 403 until password changed\n- Ensure disabling account revokes ALL sessions (already done, verify)\n\n### Phase 2: High-Priority Fixes\n\n**2.1 Fix production configuration**\n- `config.py`: `bind_port` default is already 8787 ✓\n- `db_path`: use `/var/lib/homelab-dashboard/homelab.db` in production, relative path in dev\n- `secret_key`: require non-empty in production, reject default\n- `ALLOWED_ORIGINS` default: change from `"localhost"` to empty set in production\n\n**2.2 Admin re-authentication for sensitive actions**\n- Add `POST /api/auth/reauthenticate` — takes current password, sets a short-lived re-auth marker in the session\n- Add `X-Reauth-Token` header check on sensitive admin endpoints (reset-password, update-user)\n- Re-auth token valid for 5 minutes, single-use\n\n**2.3 Temporary credentials for admin password reset**\n- `reset_password` in admin.py: generate a random 16-char temp password, hash it, return it in the response (display-once)\n- Set `must_change_pw = 1` on the target user\n- On first login with temp password, force change-password\n\n**2.4 Self-service session management**\n- `GET /api/admin/my-sessions` — list current user\'s own sessions (no admin required)\n- `DELETE /api/admin/my-sessions/{session_id}` — revoke own session\n- `POST /api/auth/logout-all` — revoke all other sessions, keep current\n\n**2.5 Fix lockout message**\n- Change `"Account locked, try again later"` to generic `"Invalid credentials"` to not reveal account existence\n\n**2.6 Tighten origin checking**\n- In production, reject requests with no Origin header on state-changing endpoints\n- Add explicit origin validation for all POST/PATCH/DELETE\n\n### Phase 3: Correctness + Tests\n\n**3.1 Fix test count documentation**\n- Run pytest, report actual count (46)\n- Fix handoff to match reality\n\n**3.2 Fix entropy terminology**\n- `secrets.token_urlsafe(48)` = 48 bytes = 384 bits of entropy (not 64)\n\n**3.3 New test categories**\n- HTTPS-aware integration test (Secure cookie behavior)\n- Bootstrap CLI tests\n- CSRF token endpoint tests\n- Self-service session tests\n- Re-auth flow tests\n- Temp credential tests\n- Generic lockout message test\n- Origin validation in production test\n- Concurrent login failure test\n- Session revocation on account disable test\n\n**3.4 Update handoff**\n- Add ChatGPT review responses section\n- Add acceptance matrix (PASS/FAIL/BLOCKED/DEFERRED)\n- Record deferred items to M8\n\n---\n\nPlease review:\n1. Is this plan sufficient to address all 10 findings?\n2. Are there any security concerns with the approach?\n3. Is the scope appropriate, or should anything be deferred?\n4. Any missing requirements from plan.md that should be addressed?\n\nProvide a "PLAN REVIEW RESULT" summary (APPROVED/NEEDS CHANGES with notes).', 'timeout': 1800000}
