17:51:54 [[chatgpt-bridge]] chatgpt-bridge.mcp INFO Tool call: name=ask_chatgpt args={'prompt': 'Please review the final M3 handoff (commit b3ffea3). Here are the key changes since the last submission:\n\n## Changes Made\n\n### 1. End-to-End Initial Password Change Tests (NEW)\nAdded `TestInitialPasswordChange` class with 2 tests:\n- `test_create_user_must_change_password`: Creates user via admin API → logs in with initial password → verifies /me returns 403 (must_change_pw=1) → changes password → verifies /me returns 200 → verifies old password no longer works\n- `test_weak_password_change_rejected`: Verifies weak passwords are rejected with 422\n\n### 2. Transactional Password Reset (FIXED)\n- `reset_password` endpoint: UPDATE users + revoke sessions now in SAME SQLite transaction (commit after both)\n- `update_user` endpoint: UPDATE users + revoke sessions now in SAME transaction\n- `revoke_user_sessions` now accepts optional `conn` parameter for transactional safety\n\n### 3. Test Count Reconciled\n- **60 passed, 0 skipped**\n- Breakdown: auth.py (25), admin.py (17), sessions.py (7), csrf.py (11) = 60\n- Previously reported 58 was missing the 2 new E2E tests\n\n### 4. CSRF Session-Binding\n- Token format: `raw_token.hmac_sha256(secret_key, raw_token || session_id)`\n- Session ID included in HMAC payload for session binding\n- Production: cookie + header must match\n- Dev/Test: header-only accepted (httpx ASGITransport limitation — manual cookie parsing in fixtures)\n\n### 5. must_change_pw Policy\n- Admin-created users: must_change_pw=1 (requires password change)\n- Self-service change-password: resets must_change_pw=0\n- Admin password reset: sets must_change_pw=1\n- Test helper `clear_must_change_pw()` for test accounts (bypasses E2E for session testing)\n\n### 6. No Production Credentials\n- All test users use test passwords\n- Database is temp file\n- No private keys or session tokens\n\nPlease verify:\n- The E2E initial password change test satisfies the requirement\n- Transactional password reset is correctly implemented\n- Test count is accurate\n- Whether M3 is ready for approval', 'timeout': 1800000}
